Do not use .+ or .- in self tests.

These operators are deprecated since Octave 7 and have been removed in Octave 9.

diff -r c085e34b5b13 -r 1a6d582e428d src/sparsersb.cc
--- a/src/sparsersb.cc	Wed Jul 26 15:37:39 2023 +0200
+++ b/src/sparsersb.cc	Fri Jul 05 21:13:39 2024 +0200
